  - Id: 10
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: "Duman alg\u0131land\u0131"
      TurkishBody: "Alan\u0131 kontrol edin ve g\xFCvenlik talimatlar\u0131n\u0131
        uygulay\u0131n."
      EnglishTitle: Smoke detected
      EnglishBody: Check the area and follow safety instructions.
    Voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d84ad78dc59deac46bb6faf3d3f698f6, type: 2}
  - Id: 309
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: "Egil\t"
      TurkishBody: "Dumandan daha az etkilenmek i\xE7in egilmeniz gerekli"
      EnglishTitle: CrouchInSmoke
